al infrastructure, not documentary imagery or financial evidence. All news content will be composed later inside x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536 on1080x1920, using actual Lato Black(weight900) for headlines/labels/figures and actual Georgia for body/sources. Later brand must be exact small single-line MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF, secondary to headline. Later headline AI REBOUND / LIFTS WALL STREET aroundy350\u2013520, brief summaryy570\u2013680, three large index cardsy760\u20131300 and source aroundy1470. Do NOT draw any of this text. Current minimum33pxalltext,35pxbody,51pxheadline will be applied at composition. Preserve a clean legible field. Final look elegant and credible, cinematic lighting, realistic refined texture, no cartoon."
